menu "devOS Network"

config DEVOS_ENABLE_WIFI
    bool "Enable Wi-Fi station at boot (needs ESP32-C6 ESP-Hosted slave)"
    default n
    help
        Bring up the Wi-Fi station (esp_wifi proxied to the ESP32-C6 over
        ESP-Hosted/SDIO) during boot.

        The C6 must first be flashed with the ESP-Hosted slave firmware
        (tools/flash_c6_slave.sh). Otherwise esp_wifi_init starts the SDIO
        transport, which aborts when the slave does not respond and puts the
        ESP32-P4 into a boot loop.

        Leave this disabled until the C6 is provisioned, then set it to y
        (here in menuconfig, or by adding CONFIG_DEVOS_ENABLE_WIFI=y to
        sdkconfig.defaults).

endmenu
